# Project Overview
This project is a CTI (Cyber Threat Intelligence) multi-agent assistant that routes user cybersecurity queries (IP, domain, hash, CVE, MITRE, research) through a pipeline of specialized agents and returns a report via CLI or Streamlit UI.

Primary goals:
- Detect query intent and indicators.
- Collect OSINT and local RAG context.
- Analyze indicators with external services.
- Generate professional CTI markdown reports.
- Apply input/output security guards.

